---
import SeahawksLayout from "../layouts/SeahawksLayout.astro";

const title = "Methodology | Seahawks Fan Zone";
const description =
  "How Seahawks Fan Zone sources and updates schedule, team stats, and player stats.";
---

<SeahawksLayout {title} {description} pageTitle="Methodology">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>What You’ll Find Here</h2>
    <p>
      Seahawks Fan Zone is a stats-and-highlights hub. Pages are generated from
      structured NFL data and updated when new results or season totals change.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Data Sources</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Game schedule and final scores</li>
      <li>Team season totals</li>
      <li>Player season stats</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      When available, I link to official or widely used public data sources and
      update the site as new games are played.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Update Timing</h2>
    <p>
      Updates typically run after games complete and may take a little time to
      propagate depending on caching and deployment.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="trending-now">
    <h2>How “Trending Now” Works</h2>
    <p>
      Trending is an editorial label with a fixed rule, not a claim about social-media activity. A story appears when an editor pins it with a future expiration, or when it was published in the last 14 days and has at least 100 verified first-party views. Expired pins are removed during the next site build. Pinned items come first; other eligible items are ordered by verified views and then publication time. The list is capped at five internal stories.
    </p>
    <p>
      When first-party analytics are unavailable, no view count is inferred and only active editorial pins can qualify. Advertisements and external links are never eligible.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Notes & Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      If you spot an error, email me at <a href="mailto:laura@caferacerstudios.com">laura@caferacerstudios.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      Seahawks Fan Zone is an independent fan site and is not affiliated with
      the NFL or the Seattle Seahawks.
    </p>
  </div>
</SeahawksLayout>
